title: "The 100 most-cited articles on non-invasive diagnosis and surveillance of bladder cancer: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Python scripts and derived data used in a bibliometric analysis of the 100 most-cited
  articles on the non-invasive diagnosis and surveillance of bladder cancer, based on the
  Web of Science Core Collection (SCI-EXPANDED), 2016-2025, searched 30 July 2026. The raw
  Web of Science records are proprietary and are not redistributed in this archive.
